WEBVTT

NOTE
Disc 1, Scene 23h: Journey toward Esthar
Duration: ~20 seconds
Source: FF8 Gameplay/Cutscene
Describes the party's travel through a desolate landscape heading toward Esthar

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
The camera pans across a barren, vast landscape. The terrain is dry and colorless — salt flats stretch to the horizon.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Squall, Rinoa (in her comatose state, held or carried by the party), and the other party members trudge forward through the desolate terrain. Their silhouettes appear small against the enormous, empty landscape.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.000
The party crosses the Horizon Bridge — a massive, long railroad bridge spanning the Great Salt Lake. The bridge stretches into the distance, diminishing toward the horizon. Below, the salt lake is a pale, flat expanse.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:16.000
The camera pulls back, showing the tiny figures of the party on the endless bridge, emphasizing the scale of their journey. The sky is gray and overcast. No structures, no life — only the desolation of the journey.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:20.000
The bridge extends onward. The party continues forward, determined despite exhaustion. In the distance, the bridge disappears into haze, suggesting they are getting closer to their destination: Esthar.
